  "story.p1": "There was a life before this one. Noise, deadlines, people. You fell asleep tired.",
  "story.p2": "And you woke up… light. As if someone had truly blessed you.",
  "story.p3": "The air tastes of cut grass. Light falls in bands, like a drawing.",
  "story.p4": "This is not your place. But it answers when you touch it.",
  "story.p5": "It becomes clear fast: here you can do anything. Chop, build, cook, fish, swim.",
  "story.p6": "And so does the rest. When the sun goes, something wakes up.",
  "story.p7": "You are not alone. There are others like you. Not all of them will be kind.",
  "story.p8": "Survive the first night. Then decide who you want to be.",

